solution:
**Given:**

Principal (P) = ₹3000

Rate of Interest (R) = 8% per annum

Time (T) = 3 years

**Formula used:**

Simple Interest (SI) = dfrac{P times R times T}{100}

**Calculations:**

SI = dfrac{3000 times 8 times 3}{100}

⇒ SI = dfrac{3000 times 24}{100}

⇒ SI = dfrac{72000}{100}

⇒ SI = ₹720

**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**
